  (descr "JNJ-L-3535AW30-80530-SL-J2-D3, 810nm IR emitter, SMD3535-3P white ceramic. Land pattern per JNJ spec rev A/2 2024-04-06: three pads 3.3mm tall, widths 0.6 / 1.0 / 0.5mm. PADS: 1=CATHODE (left), 2=ANODE (right), 3=centre thermal, NC. Package 3.5 x 3.5mm, chip 30x30 mil, 30 deg beam, Vf 2.5-2.6V, 700mA max. WARNING: overall height is 4.09mm because of the silicone dome (emitting aperture 2.8mm dia) - this is 3.5mm TALLER than the CT3030 next to it and must be resolved in the clip design.")
